參軍，卒於官。高祖踐阼，追贈穆之光祿大夫，加金章。又詔曰：「亡舅齊鎮西參軍，素風雅猷，夙肩名輩，降年不永，早世潛輝。朕少離苦辛，情地彌切，雖宅相克成，輅車靡贈，興言永往，觸目慟心。可追贈廷尉卿。」弘籍無子，從父弟弘策以第三子纘爲嗣，別有傳。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p003:m0001","object_person_mention_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p003:m0018","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-liangshu-007-zhangshangrou:p003","surface":"曾祖輿","start":16,"end":19}}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"輿為穆之曾祖。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）","human_reviewed":false,"model":null}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","generation_distance":1,"parent_person_id":"1dq_vh2_eru_A","source_assertion_id":"a-liang007-zhangshangrou-j-father-yu","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","source_id":"s-jinshu-036-zhangshangrou-forebears-ws2108231","chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-zhangshangrou-forebears","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-zhangshangrou-forebears:p002","quote":"禕字彥仲，好學，謙敬有父風，歷位散騎常侍。韙儒博，曉天文，散騎侍郎。同時遇害。禕子輿，字公安，襲華爵。避難過江，辟丞相掾、太子舍人。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-zhangshangrou-forebears:p002:m0041","object_person_mention_id":"c-jinshu-036-zhangshangrou-forebears:p002:m0039","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-zhangshangrou-forebears:p002","surface":"禕子輿","start":39,"end":42}}],"status":"contextual_provisional","interpretation_note":"晉書明記輿為禕子。","human_reviewed":false,"person_id":"1dq_vh2_eru_AA"}],"name_components":[{"id":"nc-liang007-zhangshangrou-輿","person_id":"1dq_vh2_eru_AA","ming":"輿","zi":"公安","additional_names":[],"chapter_id":"c-jinshu-036-zhangshangrou-forebears","paragraph_id":"c-jinshu-036-zhangshangrou-forebears:p002","quote":"禕字彥仲，好學，謙敬有父風，歷位散騎常侍。韙儒博，曉天文，散騎侍郎。同時遇害。禕子輿，字公安，襲華爵。避難過江，辟丞相掾、太子舍人。","status":"editorial_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"surname":"張","work_id":"w-jinshu","book_id":"b-jinshu-036","source_id":"s-jinshu-036-zhangshangrou-forebear